输入中文字符（我不确定这是否是个 bug），但一旦切换到中文输入法，键盘输入就会停止，即使切换回英文输入法也是如此。我使用的是 Ubuntu 系统的原生输入法。\n> > ### Steps to reproduce\n> > \n> > 1. At beginning,  the code editor interface: English input functions normally最初，代码编辑器界面：英文输入功能正常\n> > 2. Switch to Chinese input method切换到中文输入法\n> > 3. Attempt to input Chinese characters尝试输入中文字符\n> > 4. After this, no further input operations are possible, even if you switch back to the English input method之后，无法进行任何进一步的输入操作，即使切换回英文输入法\n> > \n> > ### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n> > \n> > 1. At beginning,  the code editor interface: English input functions normally最初，代码编辑器界面：英文输入功能正常\n> > 2. Switch to Chinese input method切换到中文输入法\n> > 3. Attempt to input Chinese characters尝试输入中文字符\n> > 4. After this, no further input operations are possible, even if you switch back to the English input method之后，无法进行任何进一步的输入操作，即使切换回英文输入法\n> \n> Is this reproducible on **godot 4.6-beta.2** or **godot 4.5.1** (_from github_) ?这是否在 godot 4.6-beta.2 或 godot 4.5.1（来自 github）上可复现？\n\nI've tried both versions you mentioned, and both can be reproduced.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3706894964/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3707169026","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114549#issuecomment-3707169026","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114549","id":3707169026,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7c9ukC","user":{"login":"stdmnpkg","id":167769650,"node_id":"U_kgDOCf_2Mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167769650?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdmnpkg","html_url":"https://github.com/stdmnpkg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdmnpkg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/us